## radiosity_sphere.rib's own scene, naming no pass. Not third-party.
Display "radiosity_sphere_off.tif" "file" "rgba"
Format 48 48 1
Projection "perspective" "fov" [45]
Clipping 0.5 50
Translate 0 0 5
WorldBegin
LightSource "pointlight" 1 "intensity" [20] "from" [2 2 2]
Surface "matte" "Ka" [1] "Kd" [1]
Color [0.8 0.8 0.8]
Opacity [1 1 1]
Sphere 1 -1 1 360
WorldEnd
